","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"108541","synopsis":"Kana and Koshigaya visit the RIMT to investigate and exterminate a new Kaii species. Guided by Vice Chief Akasaka, they face a bewildering and seemingly invincible Kaii specimen defying all common sense. Behind the scenes, ulterior motives surrounding magic power regulations cause tension as the Kaii unexpectedly mutates. With a strict time limit, Magilumiere's skills are put to the test.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iecTrR1OD5xUA0lQW07b7sSEBBZ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"108708","synopsis":"Magical Girls from Magilumiere and AST simultaneously face a rampaging new Kaii species. Koshigaya extends an olive branch to Tsuchiba, resulting in a clash of opinions that only sparks tension between their companies. The unknown Kaii rapidly mutates under the influence of magic power, after which a certain individual takes control as operator for the do-or-die battle ahead.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zebxhsLrBtOabqc2zK5opT1pMRX.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"109031","synopsis":"An improvised collaboration between Magilumiere and AST engages in a do-or-die fight against the rapidly mutating Class C Kaii. Magilumiere's fluctuating defensive and offensive tactics upset conventional methods as Kana gathers real-time data during battle to take control. Through physicality, precise control, and high-level guidance, the seemingly unbalanced team devises a plan to counterattack.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lFNaBWixM702mpkUtUHmPppg7Sp.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"109196","synopsis":"Magilumiere begins recruiting engineers to promote the Alice System. Kana struggles to convey the company's appeal while overseeing the interview process. This causes unexpected personnel to assemble, bringing the team a fresh atmosphere. When securing more talent proves difficult after serious attempts to strengthen their combat potential, Magilumiere heads to Kyoto for lectures and interviews.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ouK39FFtSHSQLgXqjtChbaV9PMF.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"109395","synopsis":"In Kyoto, Magilumiere meets engineer candidate Yamimori, who boasts impressive skills but struggles with cooperation. While compatibility with the team is called into question, he appears to be hiding certain feelings about his childhood friend Sakae and his personal values. Meanwhile, during a festival at Tonomori Shrine, a ritual unleashes a Kaii while an ominous shadow lurks behind the scenes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g2855YwcD865KNhH9OKnPfZNK0l.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"109523","synopsis":"At the Tonomori Shrine ceremony's climax, an unknown Kaii suddenly invades a barrier once believed to be safe, enveloping the area in chaos. The barrier blocks outside forces, which separates Magilumiere's team. Makino and Akasaka are forced into a struggle within the barrier while Nikoyama searches for an opening outside. With time running out, each decision will greatly influence the outcome.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w1p3WeoFcLBrXWsqZTb1KVoTN00.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"109660","synopsis":"After gaining the trust of his allies, Yamimori takes action to fight the rampaging Kaii inside the sealed barrier. Makino and Akasaka also rechallenge the front lines to face the now-overpowered Kaii with harmonious teamwork and quick thinking. The dire situation demonstrates the skill and trust between Magical Girls and their engineers as the team marches onward with full hearts.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2xs2XIyWqiLfLHTJOPw2irI84UI.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"109952","synopsis":"The Kaii at Tonomori is revealed to be someone's act of sabotage promoting a scheme to ease magic regulations behind the scenes and manipulate public opinion. Then, the culprit emerges-someone entirely unexpected. While Yamimori becomes comfortable at Magilumiere, Kana decides to confront major industry norms and her own role in the process, sparking the onset of war on a much grander scale.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o9LfLJbAFjzqfyH5NL92H82PNkE.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"110059","synopsis":"While deregulation advocates plot their next scheme, Magilumiere defies all precedents by waiting to ambush an enormous, unclassified, and highly irregular Kaii before it emerges. Koshigaya, Akasaka, and Makino struggle on the field as the Kaii's power escalates beyond all expectation while Nikoyama and Yamimori frantically work together on analysis and support from the operator's chair.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xpfvXcAqWSPSqvASYFglB3rA1wu.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"110217","synopsis":"As the battle in Tokyo Bay intensifies, Magilumiere's Magical Girls work together to take control. However, Tsuchiba from AST intervenes to turn the battle on its head with her ultra-powerful new magical device—\"Wings\"—aiming to single-handedly annihilate the target and contradict Magilumiere's cooperative combat style. Now, with tensions flaring, it's not just a fight against the Kaii anymore.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7wSKzOJ2mpDWA1BtWRGstEn4Jal.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19063","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185692","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"60552","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"240576","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"442767","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"110323","synopsis":"Amidst the raging war, Magilumiere and AST finally decide to \"cooperate\" as Shigemoto gives AST full access to the Alice System's technology to combine both companies' power for shared use among their Magical Girls. Meanwhile, Tsuchiba nearly loses control 